'''Metagross Mountain''' <!--(Japanese: '''<kanji>''' ''<direct translation>'')--> is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in the [[Sinnoh]] region. It appeared in ''[[DP117|Noodles! Roamin' Off!]]''.          

Metagross Mountain is a mountain well-known for having a dangerous {{Shiny|off-colored}} {{p|Metagross}}. Indeed, multiple people have vanished on Metagross Mountain trying to catch its namesake Metagross, despite a sign placed near the base of the mountain warning people of its dangers.

The mountain's foothills is home to a town whose biggest attraction is the flagship location of a chain of ramen shops.

[[James]] foolishly hiked up the mountain, upset after [[Jessie]] and {{MTR}} left to pursue their dreams. He challenged the Shiny Metagross to a battle, though was quickly overwhelmed. Jessie and Meowth later intervened, however the trio were soon blasted off by the Metagross.

